---
import Eyebrow from '../../ui/Eyebrow.astro';
import Rule from '../../ui/Rule.astro';
---

<section class="on-bone gutter-x section-y grid gap-6 bg-bone text-bone-text lg:grid-split-5-7">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:pr-12">
    <Eyebrow tone="bone">The Firm</Eyebrow>
    <h2 class="text-h2-sm font-light lg:text-h1">
      A focused practice for consequential agreements.
    </h2>
    <Rule tone="neutral" class="lg:hidden" />
  </div>

  <div
    class="flex max-w-2xl flex-col gap-7 text-body lg:border-l lg:border-bone-hairline lg:pl-24 lg:text-body-lg"
  >
    <p>
      Claemont Ridge Law provides professional contract drafting, review, and
      commercial legal support to clients operating across industries and
      borders. The firm works with businesses as well as individuals entering
      important professional agreements.
    </p>
    <p class="text-bone-muted">
      Its perspective is informed by commercial and corporate work, regulatory
      research, legal scholarship, and direct service to numerous international
      clients. That range of experience is brought to a deliberately focused
      practice: understanding the transaction, identifying the real points of
      exposure, and expressing the parties&rsquo; obligations with precision.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
